# S117 steep2: tele.py 95 -2.7 -30 (S106's 46-degree face, 20 ft further back along it), side on; a
# second's wait, then full gas with the stick part left, up the face, to hold the line across it.
# Wall-clock, at a quarter speed (4 ms here is 1 ms ridden).
sleep 1000
down cross
stick l -0.3 0
sleep 34000
release
